{"about_the_game":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0&quot;A New Duo, A New Adventure!&quot; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Welcome to Our Story: A spirited red panda and clever otter, bound together by fate and friendship. A fun and action packed platformer with a massive 18 levels! But when their peaceful festival is thrown into chaos by a malevolent spirit, Kreakli, trapped within the Pale Moonstone, they're thrust into an adventure like none before. Awakened within the gnarled heart of the Dark Oak Tree, Kreakli unleashes destruction upon their town. Now, it's up to Harper and Lyre to stop him before his shadow consumes everything. This is the nostalgic revival you've been waiting for! Join us on this adventure!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3579710?t=1761865989","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579710/2dc78d862fbbcda1f1c9d968ea5fc27d2c4ff944/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761865989","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579710/76e0bcb9c9b7a7ab616ac59aadf0bc53a409febf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761865989","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579710/76e0bcb9c9b7a7ab616ac59aadf0bc53a409febf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761865989","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3823640,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0&quot;A New Duo, A New Adventure!&quot; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Welcome to Our Story: A spirited red panda and clever otter, bound together by fate and friendship. A fun and action packed platformer with a massive 18 levels! But when their peaceful festival is thrown into chaos by a malevolent spirit, Kreakli, trapped within the Pale Moonstone, they're thrust into an adventure like none before. Awakened within the gnarled heart of the Dark Oak Tree, Kreakli unleashes destruction upon their town. Now, it's up to Harper and Lyre to stop him before his shadow consumes everything. This is the nostalgic revival you've been waiting for! Join us on this adventure!</p></li></ul>","developers":["StormSide Studios LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579710/cd608d6be44810e0fff961025385d3d932083558/header.jpg?t=1761865989","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3579710/1565111316/75f037bcb0aec60f0f6553fb5ddb9a9a3c0b6b83/1751888069/dash_av1.mpd?t=1752008733","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3579710/1565111316/75f037bcb0aec60f0f6553fb5ddb9a9a3c0b6b83/1751888069/dash_h264.mpd?t=1752008733","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3579710/1565111316/75f037bcb0aec60f0f6553fb5ddb9a9a3c0b6b83/1751888069/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1752008733","id":257111257,"name":"